From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:46:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] NTimeDiagonalizer: the stage query's landing edits
 (docstrings, the header's status, two Mathlib citations, blank lines, proof
 sketches)

The new docstrings drop their internal labels; the module header records the target as proved;
qy_bits_len_mono and qy_lt_two_pow_bits cite Mathlib's Nat.size_le_size and Nat.lt_size_self
through Nat.size_eq_bits_len; seven double blank lines become single; nine private proofs gain
their proof sketches. No statement changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
